#
# Counter-example for math:AutomorphismGroupShape: a math:AutomorphismGroup that
# declares its math:AlgebraicStructure frame but omits math:automorphismGroupOf
# (sh:minCount 1), so validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (and
# no other finding — an automorphism group must name the structure it is the
# symmetry of). Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecAutomorphismGroupUnanchored).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:unanchoredAutGroup a math:AutomorphismGroup ;
    math:underlyingSet ex:carrier ;
    math:structureOperation ex:composition ;
    math:satisfiesAxiom ex:assoc .

ex:carrier a math:Set .
ex:composition a math:Operation .
ex:assoc a math:Axiom .
